WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.615
Saturn, and a ring ten metres thick.

00:03.315 --> 00:10.485
The rings reach eighty thousand kilometres out from the equator and in places are ten metres from top to bottom.

00:10.935 --> 00:13.139
They are almost all water ice.

00:13.589 --> 00:20.954
Cassini circled here for thirteen years and finished by flying into the planet in September 2017.
